#X text 240 83 a classic algorithmic reverberator based on the architecture
proposed by Manfred Schroeder \, built from parallel feedback comb
filters followed by series allpass filters;
#X text 240 153 the parallel comb filters create the initial echo density
\, while the series allpass filters increase the density without adding
coloration;
#X text 240 208 this architecture became the foundation of many later
reverberation algorithms \, including the well-known Freeverb;
